    <string name="consent_title">Before you start</string>
    <string name="consent_body">Flipper One is a diagnostic toolkit for hardware you own.\n\n• NFC, IR and the bridge console can interact with nearby devices. Use them only on equipment you own or have explicit permission to test.\n\n• Radio transmission needs an external CC1101 bridge and is subject to local regulations. Never replay signals from car remotes, access systems or devices that are not yours.\n\n• Camera frames, audio and sensor readings stay in memory. The app has no network permission and no analytics.\n\n• Hidden-camera hints, EMF values and reflection detection are heuristics, not certified instruments.</string>
    <string name="consent_accept">I understand</string>
